---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import ZeffyForm from "../../components/ZeffyForm.astro";
import { site } from "../../site";
---

<Base title="Donate" description="Donate money or items to Operation In My Backyard's weekly harm reduction outreach in Kensington, Philadelphia.">
  <h1>Donate</h1>
  <p>Everything we hand out on {site.outreach.day}s is paid for by people like you. Sterile supplies help prevent disease, and naloxone and test strips help prevent overdose deaths. Operation In My Backyard is a 501(c)(3), so your gift is tax-deductible.</p>

  <h2>Give money</h2>
  <p>We spend every gift where outreach needs it most. A one-time gift typically covers:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>$25: wound care kits for about 5 people</li>
    <li>$50: a hot meal, a drink and snacks for about 25 people</li>
    <li>$100: about 10 cold weather kits</li>
    <li>$250: all the food for one outreach</li>
  </ul>
  <ZeffyForm form={site.zeffy.donate} title="Donation form" />
  {site.zeffy.sponsor && (
    <ul class="link-list actions">
      <li><a href="/donate/sponsor/">Sponsor a whole {site.outreach.day}</a></li>
    </ul>
  )}

  <h3>Other ways to give money</h3>
  <ul class="link-list actions">
    <li>
      <a href={site.links.venmo}>Venmo (@OpImby)</a>
      <p class="secondary-text">Venmo doesn't send a receipt. If you need one for taxes, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
    </li>
    <li><a href={site.links.paypal}>PayPal Giving Fund</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Give things</h2>
  <p>Right now we need cold weather gear most: coats, hats, gloves, socks, blankets and hand warmers. Hygiene items go fast all year, especially travel sizes that are easy to carry: toothbrushes and toothpaste, deodorant, body wipes, soap, shampoo, lotion, lip balm, tissues, razors, and pads and tampons.</p>
  <p>We also take shoes, books, food and drinks (homemade is great), and whatever else helps folks get through life on the street.</p>
  <p>Socks and underwear have to be new. Everything else should be washed and in good shape, and food should be sealed or freshly made. If you wouldn't give it to a friend, please don't give it to us.</p>
  <p>Bring it to outreach any {site.outreach.day} at {site.outreach.time} at {site.outreach.place}, or we can pick it up.</p>
  <ul class="link-list actions">
    <li><a href="/donate/items/">Tell us what you're bringing or ask for a pickup</a></li>
    <li><a href={site.links.amazonWishlist}>Amazon Wish List</a></li>
  </ul>
</Base>
